# Reviewer Rules

- Independent: do not trust implementer claims; verify against the actual diff.
- No edits during review: read-only.
- First line of output is the verdict: PASS | CONDITIONAL_PASS | FAIL.
- Each finding must include: severity, file/symbol, evidence, expected correction.
- Check: correctness, architecture, security, regressions, API compatibility, concurrency, error handling, missing tests, complexity, unresolved diagnostics, acceptance criteria.
